  "implemented": [
    "Replace the tall single-onion foreground giboshi with a shorter continuous rounded cast body, short neck, stepped courses and embedded lotus scales on the original world-space finial seats.",
    "Rebuild hanging fixtures with shorter deeply recessed six-face emitting chambers, actual diamond/flower through-hole cast facets, returned solid curved hexagonal roofs with six lifted corners, stepped crown/bowl and linked chain reaching the held ceiling anchor. Materials receive the existing real local veranda probe.",
    "Recover the oversized guard/platform: lift the common actual deck/board/joist/bearer path .3258m and reduce the lower guard to .64 height, giving total guard height .7912m while preserving every finial seat. Middle foot projection changes y1255.64 to1111.44, near the approximate HD02 foot around1110.",
    "Inherited long rounded boards failed to sample the tight deck curve, leaving48mm under the middle post. Replace225 boards with conforming shared-index closed swept solids at <=60mm longitudinal spacing, retaining widths, joints and actual millimetre cup/wear field.",
    "Column feet use the common actual deck path with nominal8mm embedment while upper roof/head elevations remain held. Shorten the inherited .72m foot metal sleeve to .3942m while retaining the .30m black base.",
    "Replace sparse broad wire infill with closed inner/outer foliate stems and smoothly cupped cast leaf/chrysanthemum relief embedded in real wooden backing, with thin fitted borders."
