  "personalReview": "Inspected supplied HD02 and reused existing R04 full/bridge/low captures; personally inspected R05 full/lamp hero, R06 full/lamp hero/low, R07 full/rail hero/low and all held R08 frames. No old capture was repeated because of the model transfer.",
